<title>HONG KONG: Bank of East Asia 1996 net up 14.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of East Asia 1996 net up 14.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   172.0 vs 153.0 (note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    54.5 vs 45.8 (note)</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  28.27 vs 126.9 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    1,879.5 vs 1,641.2</p>
<p>    Company name		 Bank of East Asia Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  March 3-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 8</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of East Asia's comparative share earnings and final dividend were adjusted for a one-for-five bonus issue in April 1996.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year was 80 H.K. cents (including an interim dividend of 25.5 cents) vs 82.5 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
